        "jsCode": "// Loop over input items and add a new field called 'myNewField' to the JSON of each one\n\n\n\nvar sum=0;\nconst items = $input.all();\nconst outputItems = [];\nfor (const item of items) {\n  sum += item.json.fields['customfield_10233'] ?? 0;\n}\n\n  outputItems.push({\n    json: {\n      originalKey: $('Loop Over Items').first().json.key,\n      originalDesc: $('Loop Over Items').first().json.fields.summary,\n      totalStoryPoints: sum,\n      originalStatus:$('Loop Over Items').first().json.fields.customfield_10070,\n      originalURL:\"https://trackspace.lhsystems.com/browse/\"+$('Loop Over Items').first().json.key\n    }\n  });\nreturn outputItems"
